<title>HONG KONG: Cathay flies in Macau Grand Prix cars.</title>
<headline>Cathay flies in Macau Grand Prix cars.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said it has flown 24 racing cars from London to take part in the Macau Grand Prix which takes place in the Portuguese enclave this weekend.</p>
<p>The Formula Three cars, 22 motorcycles and eight touring cars, which had been shipped to London's Gatwick airport from across Europe flew non-stop to Macau aboard a Boeing 747-200 freighter, the airline said in a statement --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
